<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 41 0 R
/E (The Pink Cafe Management System \(PCMS\) is a proposed software application designed to improve the daily operations of a cafe by organizing menu management, customer billing, receipt generation, and daily sales records. In Part 2, the Software Requirements Specification \(SRS\) identified the functional requirements, user roles, quality requirements, and technical needs of the system. Part 3 transforms these requirements into visual models that explain the system's functionality, structure, workflow, interactions, and database organization.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
