/T (The ER Diagram describes the proposed database organization of the PCMS. USERS stores authorized user information, CATEGORIES and MENU ITEMS organize the cafe menu, and SALES and SALE ITEMS record completed transactions and purchased items. RECEPTS stores the receipt information associated with each completed sale. Primary keys identify records uniquely, while foreign keys connect related records and support data integrity.)
