/Title (The Sequence Diagram shows how the Cashier and the PCMS components communicate while processing a sale. The interface retrieves menu information, the Billing Service calculates the total, the Sales Database stores the transaction, and the Receipt Service generates the receipt. The chronological arrangement clarifies the responsibilities and communication between the system components. This model helps guide the implementation of the billing scenario.)
