/Title (The Use Case Diagram defines the responsibilities of the Manager/Admin and Cashier/Staff. The Class Diagram represents the main software structure. The Activity Diagram illustrates the billing workflow. The Sequence Diagram explains communication between the cashier and system components. The ER Diagram represents the database structure and relationships.)
/Dest [15 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 998 0 R
/Prev 1716 0 R
/Next 1856 0 R
>>
